      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "Muhammad Bin Yahya, from Ahmad Bin Muhammad, from Usman Bin Isa, from Sama’at, ",
          "(It has been narrated) from Abu Abdullah<sup>asws</sup> having said: ‘When you exit from the <span class=\"iTxt\">Salāt</span>, so exit from your right’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "8. Muhammad ibn Yahya has narrated from Ahmad ibn Muhammad from ‘Uthman ibn ‘Isa from Sama‘ah who has said the following: “Abu ‘Abd Allah, ‘Alayhi al-Salam, has said, ‘When you want to move away after completing Salah (prayer) move to your right side.”’ "
        ]
      }
